{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"美國一名海軍陸戰隊員沖繩訓練期間死亡\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/JP-SOLDIER-261104-19.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】美國一名海軍陸戰隊員在日本沖繩訓練期間死亡。</p><p>海軍陸戰隊第三師發聲明指，一名隊員周二在沖繩施瓦布營訓練期間因事故喪生，當局於通知死者家屬24小時後才會公布其身份。海軍陸戰隊沒有透露死者是否當場死亡，以及是否有其他傷者。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:25:52.789608+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:20:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:40.653062+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:41.688858+00:00","content_hash":"a764badf531d2c3c1d663ea39246e9e722268324d3932c0be267c23df1b1b3c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}